OL,3,GNEWSAAlbert Bridge closure causing
OL,4,Agridlock, locals say
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than 1,100 people have signed an
OL,7,Fopen letter calling for Albert Bridge
OL,8,Fto be fixed and reopened as soon as
OL,9,Fpossible, saying the closure has left
OL,10,Fnearby roads gridlocked.
OL,12,FThe west London crossing has been shut
OL,13,Fto traffic since February, after a
OL,14,Fcrack was found in a cast iron
OL,15,Fcomponent at one of its abutments. It
OL,16,Freopened to pedestrians and cyclists in
OL,17,FApril.
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,326,320,200,140,0,100
