OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAAlbert Bridge closure causing
OL,4,Agridlock, locals say
OL,5,
OL,6,FKensington and Chelsea Council, which
OL,7,Fowns the bridge, has said it could stay
OL,8,Fclosed to vehicles until 2027 while
OL,9,Frepairs costing up to #8.5m are carried
OL,10,Fout.
OL,12,FResidents in Chelsea and Battersea say
OL,13,Fjourneys that once took minutes now
OL,14,Ftake 40-50% longer and buses have
OL,15,Fbecome unreliable.
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
